5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"Before we move desks, I need to know the recurring cost of this floor.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Minato,,I worry about how the new spots will feel for my back and ears.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,My schedule is tight. I need to know how much time we lose daily.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We should check who actually sits where now versus what the survey said.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I think we should look at how people interacted last year to see what works.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"Minato, comfort is valid, but if the budget is tight, we can't afford fancy setups.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Minato,,I just want a place where I can sit still without pain or loud noise.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"Victoria, if the billing is high, we need to justify the time cost to management.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May, time is one thing, but fairness in seat quality is another.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with Shunichi. If we ignore how we talk, we just repeat old mistakes.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the floor billing and the facilities quote for power.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Minato,,I want to check the sound meter readings and the physio's note.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I need the morning routine data and the arrival times from badge records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will review the drawn plan against the staff survey and the unplanned shuffles.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look into the two project strands and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's see what the numbers say before we commit to a shape.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Minato,,Please keep the quiet zones in mind when you look at the plans.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"If the morning routine is chaotic, I will fight for a fixed spot.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I will make sure the ""bad"" seats aren't just assigned to the same people.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope we find a way to sit together without forcing it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
