35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The billing is by area, not heads. Empty desks still cost us 41,000 yen monthly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Minato,,The window side is nine decibels quieter. My physio note says my chair needs days to settle.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The pilot floor took up to nine minutes to set up. That is too long for my gaps.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The survey wanted windows, but the plan hides three desks in the dark.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The new joiners said they learned the most by overhearing the old projects.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"Facilities charge 6,200 yen per desk to move power. Every change costs us again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Minato,,"If I move, I lose my settled chair. Can we keep the window row fixed?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"If we rotate, I lose my setup time. I need a permanent spot to save those minutes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"The shuffles last year were chaos. We need a rule, not just a new map.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"If we sit in pairs, the new people can hear the context they need.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"Moving desks is expensive. We should minimize changes to avoid the 6,200 yen fee.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I am worried. If I move, my body will hurt for days. Please keep me near the window.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,I am against any rotation. The setup time is a tax on my day. I need stability.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we keep the window row fixed, the same three people suffer the dark.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I think a mix is best. Some fixed, some shared, so we can talk.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I propose we keep the current layout mostly, but swap the two empty desks for a shared zone.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Minato,,"That sounds okay, as long as the shared zone is not by the printer.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,"If the shared zone is near my desk, I can still save time. I am in.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,We need to decide who takes the dark seats. I will push for a rotation there.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I like the shared zone. It helps the new people without forcing everyone to move.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
