60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option A keeps the power lines where they are. No 6,200 yen fees. It is the cheapest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A means I can keep my window seat. My chair will finally settle. I prefer A.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,Option C is a nightmare. I would lose my setup time every single day. I hate C.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A locks the dark seats to the same people. That is unfair. I object.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B might help the new people hear more, but it is a lot of moving.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"Shunichi, if we rotate the dark seats within Option A, we keep the cost low and fix the fairness.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Minato,,I am not sure I want to rotate. I just want my quiet spot. But I will listen.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"If Option A includes a small rotation for the bad seats, I can live with it. It saves my morning.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,A rotation of the dark seats within A is a compromise. It keeps the cost down and shares the pain.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think a small rotation in A is good. It lets us talk without moving everything.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"So we are looking at Option A, but with a quarterly swap for the three dark desks.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the swap does not put me in the dark. But I trust the group.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"I am in. As long as my main desk is fixed, I am happy. The swap is minor.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will vote for A with the swap. It is the only way to be fair without breaking the budget.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree. It balances the cost, the comfort, and the need to talk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's vote. I am for A with the swap. It is the rational choice.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am for A. I need the stability for my body. Please keep the window quiet.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I am for A. It protects my time. I will accept the small swap for the dark seats.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am for A. It is the only option that treats everyone equally over time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I am for A. It helps the new people learn without forcing a full shuffle.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
